OL,13,     Fthe waterway, as she visits
OL,14,     Friverside markets, attempts
OL,15,     Fartisanal crafts, delves into
OL,16,     FVietnam's history, and tours paddy
OL,17,     Ffields and Ho Chi Minh city.
